// Test: Negative array index (Python-style)
// Spec: 03-TYPES.md § Arrays
// Priority: P0
//
// Purpose:
// Validates that negative indices work as expected (from end).
//
// Expected behavior:
// Should print last element using -1 index

rite main() {
    ≔ arr = [10, 20, 30, 40, 50];
    println(arr[-1]);
    println(arr[-2]);
}
